OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court after #9.3m of heroin
OL,4,Afound in car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suspected drug dealer has appeared in
OL,7,Fcourt after heroin with a street value
OL,8,Fof #9.3m was seized in Bradford.
OL,10,FThe drugs were found inside a car which
OL,11,Fwas stopped on Valley Road just before
OL,12,F18:00 GMT on Monday, West Yorkshire
OL,13,FPolice said.
OL,15,FJason Smith, of Beech Walk in Dewsbury,
OL,16,Fwas arrested and appeared before Leeds
OL,17,FCrown Court on Wednesday charged with
OL,18,Fbeing concerned in the supply of
OL,19,Fheroin.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
